    faqTitle: 'Billing questions',
    faq: [
      { q: 'Which plan do we need?', a: 'Small covers scheduling, timekeeping, payroll and safety. Choose Business if you run pools, arenas or programs, Multi-complex if HR manages onboarding, discipline and leave in the app or you need single sign-on or the API, and Enterprise for everything with service commitments and the union hub.' },
      { q: 'What if we have more staff than the plan includes?', a: 'Each active person beyond your allowance is billed monthly at your plan’s rate ($8 on Small, $7 on Business, $6 on Multi-complex). Enterprise has no limit. Only people with a shift or punch that month count, so summer hiring costs only for the months it happens. For a steady budget, add staff places to your plan: they’re billed every month at the same rate and raise your allowance. It’s always billed to the organization, never to staff.' },
      { q: 'What happens if an invoice is late?', a: 'HR sees a reminder with the date the account would become read-only. After a grace period (30 days by default), the account becomes read-only until the balance is paid. Safety records, clocking in and out, signing in and paying always keep working.' },
      { q: 'How do we pay?', a: 'Monthly by invoice (EFT or cheque, net 30 by default), by credit card, or by Canadian pre-authorized debit. You can also prepay the year.' },
      { q: 'Can we sign a multi-year contract?', a: 'Yes. Commit to a term of one to five years (or the length your procurement needs) and fixed charges are discounted: 4% for a year, 8% for three years, 12% for five, and two points more if you pay the whole term up front. Invoices can come monthly, yearly in advance, or once for the whole term. Prices are held for the term; staff beyond your allowance are billed monthly for the month they work.' },
      { q: 'Can we change plans later?', a: 'Yes, up or down at any time. When a feature leaves your plan its screens are locked, and nothing is deleted: moving back up brings everything back.' },
      { q: 'Why are Multi-complex and Enterprise quoted?', a: 'Larger organizations differ in facilities, payroll setup, collective agreements and staff counts. The list price is where we start; your rate and staff allowance are confirmed in writing.' },
    ],
    endTitle: 'Get a quote for your facilities',
    endBody: 'Tell us how many facilities you run and which departments would use it. We’ll come back with a plan, each facility’s size, the staff allowance and a setup fee.',
    taxes: 'Prices are in Canadian dollars and exclude GST/HST and provincial sales tax (PST, RST or QST). Multi-facility or multi-year contracts often go through a formal RFP; we’re happy to respond.',
